# CP5638 Week 1 – Basic HTML

## Overview

This week I created a simple two-page personal website using basic HTML.

## Pages

- `index.html` – Home page with a heading, personal introduction, image, and link.
- `aboutme.html` – About Me page with personal information, an ice cream image, and a link back to the home page.

## HTML Concepts Practised

- HTML document structure
- Headings
- Paragraphs
- Images
- Alternative text (`alt`)
- Hyperlinks

## Testing

I tested both pages in a web browser and confirmed that:

- The images display correctly.
- The link from `index.html` to `aboutme.html` works.
- The link from `aboutme.html` back to `index.html` works.

## GitHub

The completed Week 1 files are stored in this repository under the `week1` folder.
